#: app/templates/landing/index.html:333
msgid "How do you know a page is really declining, and not just noisy?"
msgstr "How do you know a page is really declining, and not just noisy?"

#: app/templates/landing/index.html:337
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A page only makes the list if it clears a minimum relevance threshold, "
"has dropped at least 30%% and at least 20 clicks/month, held that drop "
"for two consecutive months, and is falling faster than the rest of your "
"site in the same period. That last check alone removes most of the false "
"alarms — it's the difference between \"your page is broken\" and \"Google"
" shipped an update and your whole site moved.\""
msgstr ""
"A page only makes the list if it clears a minimum relevance threshold, "
"has dropped at least 30%% and at least 20 clicks/month, held that drop "
"for two consecutive months, and is falling faster than the rest of your "
"site in the same period. That last check alone removes most of the false "
"alarms — it's the difference between \"your page is broken\" and \"Google"
" shipped an update and your whole site moved.\""

